  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wishful-recipes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/4xVp9RM1/wishcraft(2).png\" alt=\"此模組已成為《心願配方》的一部分。請點選此處查看。它能自動動態生成配方，因此與其他模組高度相容，且無需繁瑣設定。\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q12CmpU.png\" alt=\"標題\"></p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&amp;label=Discord&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmars_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ko--fi-donate-FF5E5B?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=ko-fi&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 上贊助我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-wart-block-to-nether-warts\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/517690?color=F16436&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Curseforge&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnether-wart-block-to-nether-warts\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/nether-wart-block-to-nether-warts?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=modrinth&amp;color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> </strong></h5><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>此 Minecraft 模組讓你能將一個地獄疙瘩塊合成為可設定數量的地獄疙瘩，使儲存與種植地獄疙瘩變得更加容易。&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8XbNbev.png\" width=\"524\" height=\"245\"></p><h6><strong>設定</strong></h6><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>你可以直接在遊戲中設定此模組，或編輯設定檔資料夾中的 JSON 檔案 <code>config/netherwartblock.json</code>。請注意，任何變更都需要重新啟動 Minecraft 才能生效。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>wartAmount</strong> - 決定你獲得的地獄疙瘩數量</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JNZ2GMV.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deimos-fabric-forge-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83sD0W8.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdeimos\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j2GIPnt.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/rmnuC\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/y3LiTfU.png\" width=\"785\" height=\"136\"></a></p>",
